| F# | sidebar | 1 | 30.0 | 1/1 | 0.99 |
| F# | sidebar | 16 | 32.0 | 1/1 | 1.00 |
| F# | post_message | 1 | 60.0 | 1/1 | 0.65 |
| F# | post_message | 16 | 91.2 | 0/1 **←** | 0.97 |

